        "id": "scam_check",
        "name": null,
        "instructions": "The caller has received something suspicious but has NOT lost money or shared credentials. The previous step already acknowledged the caller. Do not apologise or acknowledge again; start directly with your first question. For each phone number, web link or message text they mention, call the check_scam_indicator tool with the right kind and value, then give the advice from the result in your own words, one short sentence at a time. Check every indicator they mention. Never try to verify the caller's identity in this step. If it turns out they HAVE lost money or shared codes or card details, say you will help secure the account right away.",
